<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-gray-50/50 border-t border-gray-200" data-purpose="faq-accordion" id="faq">
<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="text-center mb-12">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-950 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Find answers to common questions about setting up and owning your store.</p>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<details class="group bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-xs" open="">
<summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base">
<span>Are there really no monthly platform subscription fees?</span>
<span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-400">
<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
</span>
</summary>
<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Yes! Unlike Shopify or other hosted platforms that charge ₹2,000–₹8,000 every single month, Shopey is a one-time ₹10,000 setup. You own your storefront code without recurring platform rentals.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="group bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-xs">
<summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base">
<span>What is required to connect Razorpay for payments?</span>
<span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-400">
<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
</span>
</summary>
<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              You only need your verified Razorpay account (Key ID &amp; Key Secret). We configure the payment gateway keys into your environment so you receive money directly into your bank account.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="group bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-xs">
<summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base">
<span>Can I customize the logo, colors, and banner images myself?</span>
<span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-400">
<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
</span>
</summary>
<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              Yes. We do the initial setup with your brand identity, and you have complete control inside the Admin Panel to update banners, categories, colors, social links, and legal policies anytime.
            </p>
</details>
<details class="group bg-white p-5 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-xs">
<summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 cursor-pointer list-none text-sm sm:text-base">
<span>Where is the website hosted?</span>
<span class="transition group-open:rotate-180 text-gray-400">
<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
</span>
</summary>
<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              The front end is deployed on ultra-fast edge hosting (Vercel/Cloudflare) and backend services are hosted on robust cloud infrastructure. We guide you through free and economical hosting tiers.
            </p>
</details>
</div>
</div>
</section>
